id: pm-1ieq24
title: "GH-1340: pm duplicates treats UTF-8 prose as a 0.99 issue-code match"
description: The published pm duplicates path gives unrelated CSV import/export tasks a 0.99 issue_code score because UTF-8 is treated as an identifier. Preserve complete true issue codes while excluding ordinary technical terms and prose compounds.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-28T16:19:13.303Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-28T18:08:45.672Z"
