completed_at: "2026-09-28T17:13:42.261Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: Evidence-backed issue-code extraction is shared or aligned across duplicate scoring and validation; UTF-8 and Match-3 negative controls plus complete true-code positive controls pass; command-level duplicate output is verified in an isolated tracker.
parent: pm-33cw
risk: medium
confidence: 85
severity: high
repro_steps: "In an isolated workspace, create tasks titled Export --excel with UTF-8 BOM and Import --encoding UTF-8 input; run pm duplicates --json."
resolution: SDK duplicate scoring rejects technical prose identifiers while retaining true project issue-code matches; CLI and SDK regression coverage plus a recurrence gate added
expected_result: UTF-8 and Match-3 prose must not force duplicate clusters; shared GH-672 codes must still match
actual_result: Isolated CLI and SDK tests and packed npm/Bun consumers passed; full suite passed 9399 tests with exact 100/100/100/100 coverage
affected_version: 2026.9.28
component: similarity-scoring
