comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-28T16:19:13.303Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: searched all statuses for UTF-8, issue_code, similarity-scoring, natural-language identifiers, and related GitHub issues. Closed pm-blvfye fixed validation prose classification; closed pm-sn3xor preserved complete letter-suffixed duplicate codes. Neither fixed this pm duplicates regression. Source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1340. New recurrence owns only the duplicate-scoring defect."
  "2026-09-28T17:13:34.951Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence 2026-09-28: SDK similarity scoring now distinguishes technical prose such as UTF-8 and Match-3 from project issue codes while retaining GH-672 and BD-30-A identity matches. Regression was red before the fix. Linked SDK plus isolated CLI test passed. Full suite: 9,399 tests passed, 2 platform skips; statements 65,810/65,810, branches 50,372/50,372, functions 13,611/13,611, lines 62,853/62,853. Static source/export/member docstring coverage 100%. Defect recurrence gate passed. Packed tarball in temporary npm and Bun consumers passed via npx and bunx; false duplicate cases remained separate and true GH-672 matched."
  "2026-09-28T17:38:09.263Z","harness:codex","PR #1341 review follow-up: Greptile identified two scoring gaps at the exact PR head: genuine TASK-7 and Gh-672 matches could be lost, and unlisted lowercase match-10/chart-404 prose could still force 0.99 identity. Updated the prefix evidence rule and SDK/CLI regressions; focused tests pass. The title-case technical false-positive protection remains."
  "2026-09-28T17:58:22.771Z","harness:codex","PR #1341 review correction verified: genuine TASK-7 import and Gh-672 are retained, while lowercase match-10 and chart-404 prose is excluded. Focused SDK and CLI tests pass. Full post-review suite: 9,399 passed, 2 platform skips; exact statements 65,809/65,809, branches 50,370/50,370, functions 13,611/13,611, lines 62,852/62,852."
  "2026-09-28T18:08:45.672Z","harness:codex","PR #1341 review revision final local evidence: post-review full coverage 9,399 passed with exact 100/100/100/100; pnpm quality:static passed; linked PM tests for the three items passed; packed temporary npm/npx and Bun/bunx consumers passed on the rebuilt source."
